// Omnia app target settings.
//
// Tracker sign-in uses Omnia's own registered apps, as Nuvio does: users
// sign in with a code or in the browser and never create an app themselves.
// The IDs (and Trakt's secret) come from Config/Secrets.xcconfig, which git
// ignores. Copy Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig to Config/Secrets.xcconfig
// and fill it in; without it, those sign-ins say they aren't configured.

OMNIA_TRAKT_CLIENT_ID =
OMNIA_TRAKT_CLIENT_SECRET =
OMNIA_TRAKT_REDIRECT_URI =
OMNIA_SIMKL_CLIENT_ID =
OMNIA_MDBLIST_CLIENT_ID =
OMNIA_ANILIST_CLIENT_ID =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
